 "description": "<p>The bunny girl one-piece in black with a three-size run and printed measurements: M covers bust 76-110 cm and waist 60-78 cm for 40-50 kg, L covers bust 85-120 and waist 75-90 for 50-60 kg, XL covers bust 100-130 and waist 85-100 for 55-65 kg.</p>\n<p>The jumpsuit arrives with its headband as a two-piece set. The printed measurements matter here more than in chiffon categories - this is a fitted one-piece, and the fit is the costume.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: jumpsuit, headband</li>\n<li>Style: bunny girl one-piece</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: M / L / XL with per-size bust and waist measurements, 40-65 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Match your measurements to the chart line by line. The XL range at bust 100-130 cm is real, not a label.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black one-piece bunny uniform with headband in M, L and XL, each size printed with bust and waist ranges.</p>\n",
